  "about": "The 33 generated garments for the realistic wardrobe under ADR-0046: one entry per source file (matched by the start of its name), tagged with its HomeFrame (`masculine`, `feminine`, or `unisex` — unisex items generate both masculine and feminine home-frame variants), ProxyKind (`body` or `skirt` for dresses, skirts, and long coats), anatomical placement `z_range` (metres, Y-up) and `has_sleeves` for upstream Blender prep (`prep_meshy_garments.py`), and browser metadata (`slot`, `layer`, `also_fills`). Non-destructive `Shrink_Under` and ADR-0045 cover maps replace the old two-round `Hang` fitting.",
